# Copy this file to `.env` in the same folder (client/.env) to override the defaults.
# This is optional: without it, the app talks to the API on the SAME origin as the page
# (relative /api, /socket.io paths), which `vite.config.ts`'s dev-server proxy forwards to
# http://localhost:4000. Only set this if the client and API are genuinely served from
# different origins (e.g. a production deployment without a shared reverse proxy).
# client/.env is git-ignored — never commit real secrets.

# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
